#15501
A Mysterious Dolmen~
   Set firmly in the ground before you is an ancient dolmen, its surface 
covered in lichen and its corners weathered to a rough hewn.  It looks as 
though it hasn't been disturbed in ages; in fact there isn't a single track
from an animal near it, save for what appear to be tracks left behind by men.
~
