The Oak Grove~
   Another magnificent grove, but these great oaks are the most revered of
all trees by Druids throughout the realms.  Many an ArchDruid and greater
have come here to draw upon the power of these ancient oaks, some more than 
half a millennium old.  The oaks, in their rows, stand in silence, possibly
considering your worthiness to even set foot here.  This is a rarely
disturbed area where animals roam freely, with no apparent fear of harm.
