   You are following a rather precarious ledge that rises along the outer
curve of the mound.  The narrow path created by the ledge is covered with
a thin layer of white sand, making it more visible in contrast with the
mound.  The path is slightly banked towards the mound here making footing
less difficult.  The wind currents seem to strengthen as you continue west.
~
