#15570
The Western Cave Opening~
   So this mound is not completely earthen as it appeared to be!  You are
standing at the northern-most extremity of the mound, which is very rocky
and mountainous.  In addition to that fact is the presence of a large cave
to the west.  Great gusts of wind seem to be emanating from within.  Every 
few moments a gust rushes into you, almost knocking you off your feet.
