#15571
The Home of Zephirus~
   A very comfortable looking cave, with smooth walls and a packed-hard dirt
floor.  Would be a nice place to rest, you think, if it were not for the
excessive howling of wind that permeates this cave.  Perhaps you have not
come to realize just who resides HERE.  Why Zephirus, the mighty West Wind,
of course.  South, you may venture deeper into the cave.
~
