#15575
Inside the Lookout~
   You are standing on a stairwell, almost halfway up to the top of this 
ancient lookout tower.  You are surrounded by gray stone walls that may have 
been built many centuries ago.  They still hold strong, save for a collapsed 
portion of the lower eastern wall.  It looks large enough for your average
big guy to crawl through, but YOU REALLY DO NOT WANT TO RISK YOUR LIFE 
exploring there, since you can see enough through the wall to tell you that
there is a tremendous chasm on the other side.  A trapdoor is above you.
~
