#15577
Very Top of Lookout~
   Quite an eyeful!  You can see very clearly now, why this place is called 
the Isle of Druids -- fog, swamp, and impenetrable forest cut-off this
earthen mountain from every direction, except for that luminous path which
cannot be seen at all from up here through the fog.  The sky is thankfully
clear and wide, and you can barely make out the small towers atop the walls
of Midgaard to the east. To the north, one could only guess what lies beyond
the forests of Hahn-Dor and to the south, you recognize the routes to other
civilizations.
~
