Circle of Stones~
   You have walked into the midst of a circle of erect stones, most of which
are over ten feet high.  With the sun overhead, you can almost see their
shadows move; this is aptly referred to as the giants' dance.  The ground
is well-tread here, given that this is a place of great ceremony at least
once every month.  You notice a fallen stone in the northeast quadrant.
~
